{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setappcode:"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setAppCode:","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setAppCode:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setAppCode:"}],"title":"setAppCode:"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the Pushwoosh Application Code programmatically."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setAppCode:"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setAppCode:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"appCode"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"appCode","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your Pushwoosh Application Code (e.g., “XXXXX-XXXXX”)"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Application Code uniquely identifies your app in the Pushwoosh system.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"You can find it in the Pushwoosh Control Panel under your application settings."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While you can set the code programmatically, the recommended approach is to configure"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it in your Info.plist file using the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Pushwoosh_APPID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key."}]},{"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Configure app code during white-label app initialization:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class WhiteLabelConfigurator {","","    func configure(with config: AppConfiguration) {","        \/\/ Set Pushwoosh app code based on client configuration","        Pushwoosh.configure.setAppCode(config.pushwooshAppCode)","","        \/\/ Continue with other SDK setup","        Pushwoosh.configure.setDelegate(notificationHandler)","        Pushwoosh.configure.registerForPushNotifications()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setAppCode:baseUrl:"},{"text":", changing the Application Code here ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"drops","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" that endpoint and falls back to"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the default (Info.plist ","type":"text"},{"code":"Pushwoosh_BASEURL","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", otherwise","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/<appCode>.api.pushwoosh.com\/json\/1.3\/"},{"type":"text","text":"), so one application’s data can never be addressed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to the host chosen for another one. A warning naming the dropped endpoint is logged. To move an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"application and its endpoint together, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setAppCode:baseUrl:"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"leaves** whenever the Application Code actually changes, addressed to that application’s own host, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the device stops receiving its pushes. The local push token is kept, so the device registers into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new application right away. Re-applying the code the SDK already holds changes nothing and sends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"nothing.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setAppCode:":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the Pushwoosh Application Code programmatically."}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setappcode:","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setAppCode:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setAppCode:"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setAppCode:"}],"title":"setAppCode:"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"type":"topic"}}}